# vision/.gitignore — privacy firewall (ADR-0023 §3). MUST be in force before any clip lands.
# Footage and weights NEVER enter version control.
# `models/*`, NOT `models/` — git never descends into an excluded DIRECTORY, so the
# `!models/MANIFEST.json` re-include below is dead under `models/`. Excluding the
# directory's *contents* individually keeps the weights out while letting the negation
# apply. (`*.pt` below is the belt-and-braces second line.)
models/*
samples/
out/
# The attestation ledger's home — deliberately OUTSIDE out/, which retention prunes. It records
# every link processed, so it is working data and never enters version control.
# (This comment is on its own line on purpose: .gitignore honours '#' only at the START of a line,
# so a trailing comment becomes part of the pattern and the rule silently matches nothing.)
var/
config/calibration.yaml
*.360
*.mp4
*.mov
*.pt
*.engine
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# Committed despite the above (carry no footage/weights/keys):
!models/MANIFEST.json
!samples.manifest.jsonl
